{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/12/30/0937046/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3月のライオンカフェに\n行って来ました～～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマス当日だったから\n空いててほしいなあ～～と\n期待して行ったんだけど\n満席でした('ﾛ'('ﾛ'('ﾛ' )!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3月のライオンの人気すごい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/12/30/0937046/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母がカレーで私が角煮丼。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういうコラボカフェは\n自分の好きな空間に\n浸れるので幸せですよね～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日でコラボカフェ\n終わりだったみたいなんだけど\nまた復活が決まっているそうなので\n今から楽しみです（＾ω＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっという間に12月も終わり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12月は有難いことに\nバタバタとしていましたが\nなんとか欅ちゃんのライブ\n見に行ってきたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残念ながら途中からだけど(´；ω；`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乗り遅れたバスから見たよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/12/30/0937046/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の気になってるヘドバンの曲は\n1曲目だったらしいね(´；ω；`)\nざんねん(´；ω；`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めてのワンマンで\nあれだけのパフォーマンスで\n凄いグループだなあって\n改めて思いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/12/30/0937046/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂とはライブのチームが違うらしいので\nいろんな発見があって\n勉強になりました！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/12/30/0937046/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"欅ちゃん、ひらがなちゃん\nお疲れ様でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/12/30/0937046/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年の紅白も有難いことに\nアンダーも出られることになりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"35人でのパフォーマンスは\nこれが最後になるのかな？\nまだ分からないけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"噛み締めてきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/12/30/0937046/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"載せる写真なくて全然関係ないやつ。(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"流行語大賞の発表は\n明日の17時を予定しています（＾ω＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"か  り  ん  (っｴ`o)"}],"source":"archive"}